      "comment": "UNCLE STILTSKIN (1) is worth forgiving last start after finishing fourth (30.12) from Box 8 at Sandown over 515m. Good beginner assisted by the inside draw. Can make amends. PAW MATIC (2) finished sixth last time at Horsham but could not have been more impressive before that in her superb 23.16 win at Horsham over 410m. Rates a leading chance if runs up to recent winning time. MOTHER GEORGIA (7) missed the frame latest when sixth at The Meadows (30.54) but was a winner four back in the best time of the program. The form from her last run stacks up well. Deserves plenty of respect. REPELLENT (6) form at this distance reads well.",
